Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你该亲眼瞧瞧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You should have seen yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时站在椅子上漂来漂去的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Up on that stool, floating around up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,迪朵夫对着你大呼小叫\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Deardorff just hollering at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很搞笑\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It felt funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉应该很爽\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I bet it felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你晚上要干什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What you gonna do at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量多熬会儿夜把书看了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm gonna stay awake as long as I can, reading my book,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,学习西西里防御\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}learning the Sicilian Defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,书里用了57页讨论西西里防御\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's 57 pages about it in the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,兵要移到后翼象线第四格就衍生出170条线\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}with 170 lines stemming from P to QB4.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把它们都记住 然后在脑海里下棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm gonna memorize them and play through them all in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.79,0:00:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的脑袋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Poor mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,姑娘们 别跑\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Ladies, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别推推搡搡\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No shoving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,萨贝先生\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mr. Shaibel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不肯再让我下棋了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They won't let me play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我被处罚了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm being punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可以帮帮我吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我还能跟你下棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I wish I could play more with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.95,0:02:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你怎么还不起床\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}For crying out loud, what you still doing in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再不起床就错过早餐时间了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're gonna miss breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 小白\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Morning, cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不想再错过好吃的早餐吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You don't wanna miss another delicious breakfast, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦都想吃\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Been dreaming about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道他们为谁而来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Wonder who they're here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hi, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-你想把她惹毛吗  -我得洗个澡啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Are you trying to piss her off? - I had to take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那赶紧进去吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Go on in, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看起来人不错\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They seem like nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 我听说你上个月刚满13岁\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm told, Elizabeth, that you turned 13 just last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我今年15...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Actually, I'm fift...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我13岁了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, that's right, I'm 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是花一般的年纪\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Such a wonderful age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白的学业向来很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Elizabeth has performed well in all of her schoolwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她的阅读和算术能力在班上名列前茅\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She is at the top of her class in reading and arithmetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,科学和地理也是她的强项\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth is also a very strong student in science and geography,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她经常帮助朗斯岱小姐处理教堂的事务\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and has been kindly assisting Miss Lonsdale with chapel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.45,0:04:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年来风雨不改\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}for several years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她是梅修之家的楷模\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She is the model Methuen girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先熟络一下吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I will leave you three to get acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫你伊丽莎白\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They call you Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.37,0:05:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还是贝蒂\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Or is it Betty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你该去打包行李了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You should go pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到那本书了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I can't find my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一本 你读过的书太多了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Which book we talking about? You read like a hundred of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"现代国际象棋开局步法"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Modern Chess Openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hm. Beats the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我明明放在这里的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I left it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没看到吗  -少诬赖我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- You didn't see it, did you? - Watch who you go accusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那种书对我来说屁用没有\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I got no use for no book like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,再说你也不需要那些书\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Anyway, you don't need no book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只要对他们俯首称是就行了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Just say, "Yes, sir," and "Yes, ma'am," and you'll do all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们你很感恩 能加入这么一个基督教家庭\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Tell them you're grateful to be in a Christian home like theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们会在你房里放一台电视呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Maybe they'll put a TV in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,乔琳\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛道歉\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我替你没被领养感到难过\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That you didn't get adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里过得很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I make out just fine right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 要乖乖的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Be a good girl, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出发了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很高兴能有个比较大的孩子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We're so glad to have an older child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是罗莎·博纳尔的画作\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Those are Rosa Bonheur prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 不是原作\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Not originals, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢小动物吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Do you like animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢小动物\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I do, I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯顿对多数宠物毛屑过敏\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Allston is allergic to most pet dander, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不能...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}so I'm not allowed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该很想看看你的房间吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I bet you'd like to see your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是主卧 我和奥斯顿的房间\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This is the master bedroom, where Allston and I sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这边是浴室\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Over here is the bathroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的房间了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and this is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想买优质的枫木家具可费劲了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You have no idea how hard it is to find good maple furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是我的吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This is all mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Of course it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,整个房间\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The whole room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The whole room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你先收拾行李安顿一下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I will let you unpack and get settled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙就喊一声\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Just give a holler if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道有什么需要弄明白的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't know exactly what there is to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么不派其他人去  -也就两个星期\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Why can't they send someone else? - It's only for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你才在家待两天就要走了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You've only been home for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你正好有时间去了解你的新伙伴\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Gives you some time to get to know your new companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,估计你能了解的也不多\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I doubt there's much to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小姑娘似乎话不多\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Girl doesn't seem to have a heck of a lot to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,非要把车也开走吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Do you have to take the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不开车我能去哪\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How am I supposed to get around without a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 你大可去租一辆\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't know, you could rent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后浪费我一半的佣金吗 再说你的驾驶技术也不行\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And eat up half my commissions? You're a terrible driver anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咱家离城里也不远\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's not that far into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,记住医生的叮嘱 多运动对你有益\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Remember what the doctor said. Some exercise will do you good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,时候还早 亲爱的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's early, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以再睡一个小时\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You don't have to be up for another hour yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是你第一天上学 你肯定很兴奋吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Must be all the excitement about your first day of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,惠特利先生去哪里了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Where did Mr. Wheatley go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,出差去了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Business trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜他最近经常出差 可是...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Poor man has to travel quite a bit these days, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他也经常提醒我...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}as he likes to remind me, it…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们才能吃饱穿暖\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}keeps the roof over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别盯着我看了 我都紧张起来了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Please stop gawking, dear, you're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你弹得很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我外婆琼留下的钢琴\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This was Grandmother June's piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我在年纪比你还小的时候就开始弹琴了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've played since I was younger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直梦想加入交响乐队\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'd always had it in my mind to one day play in an orchestra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也许还来得及\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Probably still could.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不巧的是\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mmm. As luck would have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我怯场得厉害\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've also always suffered from a terrible case of stage fright,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,对渴望表演的人来说可不是好兆头\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}which does not bode well for an aspiring performer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我怀孕了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And then I got pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有过孩子吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You have a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有过\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We did, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的炖菜还剩了一些\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We have a leftover casserole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,贝丝 亲爱的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不需要我陪你上学吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Are you sure you don't want me to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己能行\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你该亲眼看看那个教练\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You should have seen that coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看到她的头发和鞋子了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Have you seen her hair and her shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,土得掉渣\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So drab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,棕色鞋搭配棕色鞋带 真是...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And brown laces with brown shoes? I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静 开始上课\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Quiet, please! Let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这周我们开始学习二项式定理\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}This week, we will begin to study the binomial theorem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁知道什么是二项式吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Does anyone know what a binomial is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,请说吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-二项式是一种数学...  -请站起来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- A binomial is a mathematical... - Will you stand up, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,二项式是一种包含两个项的数学公式\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}A binomial is a mathematical expression containing two terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,X加Y就是一个二项式\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}X plus Y is a binomial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,请翻到第24页\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Let's turn to page 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 又是个书呆子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Great, another fucking brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意 天啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's a good idea. Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-学校里有棋艺学会吗  -什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Is there a school chess club? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这所学校里有棋艺学会吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is there a chess club here at the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没有\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't think they have anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但是多数女生都入了社团\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}But a lot of the girls belong to social clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,社团\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Social clubs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有苹果派社团\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's the Apple Pi club,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,准名媛社团\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and the Sub Debs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-上城女孩社团  -苹果派 是吃的那个"派"吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- and Girls Around Town. - Apple pie? They bake pies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 读音跟代表圆周率的希腊字母一样\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No, Apple Pi. You know, like the Greek letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是社团成员吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Are you in one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要受到邀请...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You have to be invited…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,才能加入\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以尝试加入初级拉拉队\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You could try out for junior cheerleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.75,0:17:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 惠特利先生\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hello, Mr. Wheatley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你好... 贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hi… Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来了 我还以为你一星期后才回来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're home! I didn't expect you for another week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是回来过一夜\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm only here for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们... 他们把整个西南地区都交给我 所以...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They, uh… they just gave me the whole Southwest, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这样应该会加薪吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And a raise, I hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你先去梳洗一下 我马上开始做晚餐\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, why don't you freshen up, and I will start dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想喝一瓶啤酒\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll take a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要是还有的话\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If there's any left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她从来不换衣服吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Doesn't she ever change clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像不太喜欢我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't think he likes me very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,主张领养你的其实是他\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Adopting you was actually his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得对 你需要新衣服\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He's right, though. You could use some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有国际象棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They have chess sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下来了再看吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We can stop on the way back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我来给你找件上衣\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Let's find you a blouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很好看吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well, don't you look lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这双鞋有点大了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The shoes are a little big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你还会继续长个的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Room to grow, dear. Room to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来找外套吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Let's look for coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很好看\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mmm. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,站到这边来 我看看面料在灯下怎么样\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Step over here so I can see the fabric in the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很好看\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, this will do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不看国际象棋吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Aren't we gonna look at the chess sets?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.83,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,改天吧 亲爱的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Another time, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,时候不早了 我有点饿了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's getting late, and I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-可是...  -我每星期会给你40美分零花钱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- But... - I'll give you 40 cents a week allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你把钱存起来再买一套国际象棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Save up and buy yourself a chess set.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻女孩学习存钱大有裨益\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Saving is a good lesson for a girl to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真难看\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-这里有跟国际象棋相关的书吗  -国际象棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Do you have any books on chess? - Chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不清楚\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mm. I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有的话 应该在最后一排\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If we have anything, it'll be on the last row.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定你能找到何塞·卡帕布兰卡的自传\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There might be an old biography on José Capablanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁  -何塞·卡帕布兰卡\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Who? - José Capablanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是个特级大师 但那是很久以前的事了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He was a Grandmaster. It was quite a long time ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"特级大师"是什么意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What's a Grandmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就是指天才棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}A genius player.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你了 哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I see you, Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.45,0:22:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那双鞋让你暴露了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's those shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.45,0:22:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是在班斯奈德时装店买的吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Did you get them at Ben Snyder's or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.29,0:22:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我死也不会去那家店\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I wouldn't be caught dead in Ben Snyder's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-学校怎么样  -很好玩\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- How was school? - Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要复盘这本书里的棋局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm gonna replay some of the matches in this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-但你没有棋盘  -棋盘在我脑袋里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- But you don't have a board. - In my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.66,0:23:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不错的脑力训练\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good mental exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,做些体力训练对你有好处\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well, some physical exercise could do you good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你能替我跑一趟布莱德利杂货店\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Will you run over to Bradley's for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,买三包吉时香烟吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and pick up three packs of Chesterfields?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.37,0:23:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 夫人\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你写一张条子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll write you a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来这么小 不像是会抽烟的样子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You look a bit youthful for smoking, yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小姑娘\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.37,0:25:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要么买下 要么放回去\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You have to buy the magazine or put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.25,0:25:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-我可不可以...  -想看吗 先看那个指示牌\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Can't I just... - You wanna read? Read the sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.00,0:25:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 油都一样的 只是大小不一样\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No, it's all the same oil, it's just three different sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.08,0:25:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你用的不多就买这瓶\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you don't use a lot, you wanna buy that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.29,0:25:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为油会变质 但是买这瓶最划算\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}because it does go bad, but this is the best value for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要是做不了决定就买中瓶 没什么好纠结的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you can't decide, get the middle one. It's not rocket science.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.08,0:26:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 亲爱的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最后一杯速溶咖啡了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well, that's the last of the instant coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算去逛街 但是不知道钱都花哪儿去了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'd go shopping, but I just don't know where all the money goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.29,0:26:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个月的开支稍微大了一点\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've bought little more than trifles this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.20,0:26:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,结果只剩下7美元 我以为至少还能剩下20美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and yet I have seven dollars left where I should have at least 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.08,0:26:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,7美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Seven dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.04,0:26:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-够吗  -够不够撑到10月底吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Is that enough? - To last till the end of October?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.79,0:26:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不够吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只够用来买鸡脖和粥\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It'll scarcely buy chicken necks and porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.70,0:26:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-梅修之家没寄支票来吗  -只寄来80美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Doesn't Methuen send you a check? - For 80 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.87,0:26:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,而且只有第一年会寄钱来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And only for the first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得好像这笔钱能养你一辈子似的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}As if the expense of keeping you doesn't exhaust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.75,0:26:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看来只有等奥斯顿回来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm afraid you'll have to go without an allowance
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.70,0:26:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能给你零花钱了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}until Allston returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.62,0:26:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他什么时候回来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Which is when?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:26:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Who can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.25,0:27:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像被迫留在西部了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It seems he's been unavoidably detained out West.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我可以去找份工作\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Maybe I could get a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.08,0:27:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,找份工作\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}A job?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.08,0:27:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以找家店铺打工 或是去洗盘子什么的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I could work in a store, or wash dishes somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.25,0:27:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,洗盘子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Wash dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.45,0:27:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想挣点钱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'd like to make some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.45,0:27:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你是想买衣服吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Oh, to buy clothes with, I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.91,0:27:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我想参加国际象棋比赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}To enter chess tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.58,0:27:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这边就有一个\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.83,0:27:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但报名费要5美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}But it's five dollars for the entrance fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.04,0:27:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只有有色人种才会在你这个年纪去打工\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The only girls of your age who work are colored.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.29,0:27:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的萨贝先生\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Dear Mr. Shaibel,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.16,0:27:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有一场国际象棋锦标赛 第一名的奖金是100美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}there's a chess tournament here with a first prize of 100 dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.41,0:27:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,第二名的奖金是50美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and a second prize of 50 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.33,0:27:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他奖项\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There are other prizes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.91,0:27:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但报名费要5美元 我没有这么多钱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It costs five dollars to enter, and I don't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.95,0:28:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你愿意寄这笔钱给我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you'll send me the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.33,0:28:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果得奖 我就会还你10美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I will pay you back ten dollars if I win any prize at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,贝丝 是你吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.87,0:28:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像感冒了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I seem to have caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.79,0:28:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又感冒了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.70,0:28:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像容易招惹病毒 不然就是...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mm. I have a proclivity for viruses, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.25,0:28:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒喜欢招惹我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}they for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.45,0:28:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Uh… here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.75,0:28:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去帮我拿药\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I need you to fill this prescription for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.12,0:28:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你要去那边...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And while you're there…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.75,0:28:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,给自己买一瓶可乐吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}buy yourself a Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.70,0:28:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.33,0:28:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Be just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.33,0:29:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.79,0:29:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的镇静药\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}My tranquility medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.66,0:29:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,陶伯特医生决定我需要更多镇静剂\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Dr. Talbott has decided I need more tranquility. Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.20,0:29:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-亲爱的 可以帮我拿一杯水来吗  -好的 夫人\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Will you get me a glass of water, dear? - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.12,0:29:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么他们只装半瓶\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Why do they only fill these bottles half full?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.87,0:30:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没长眼睛吗 哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Excuse you, Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.66,0:30:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,操你妈的 玛格丽特\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Fuck you, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.41,0:30:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.54,0:30:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的信\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}this came for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.83,0:30:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,叫艾玛少吃点\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Tell Alma to go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.79,0:31:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她还可以补充三次\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}She's only got three refills left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.70,0:31:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,白宫再次宣称的一次非政治目的的行程...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}For a trip the White House again calls non-political…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.37,0:31:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-这么晚才回来  -...17名民主党参议员\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- You're home late. - …political-looking escort
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.79,0:31:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,组成的大队充满了政治色彩 肯尼迪夫人...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}of 17 Democratic congressmen, and Mrs. Kennedy…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.45,0:31:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-我刚才在外面散步  -...还亲自迎接...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I was out walking. - …who was featured at the arrival…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.29,0:31:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 晚安\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Okay. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.08,0:31:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,... 展露笑容...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}… turning on the smile that hasn't been…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天也会晚回来 我放学后有事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm gonna be late again tomorrow. I have something after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你加入社团了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Have you joined a club?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.87,0:32:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去参加那天跟你提过的国际象棋比赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm playing in that chess tournament I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.50,0:32:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不反对你这个年纪的女孩\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I won't argue that broadening one's social life
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,扩大社交圈子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}is important for a girl your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.20,0:32:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得去参加舞蹈班或女子社团\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I just wonder whether a dance class or a girls' club
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.04,0:32:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,会比较容易交上朋友\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}wouldn't be better for making friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听说费尔菲尔德高中有不错的社团\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I hear Fairfield has pretty good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.83,0:32:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在我这么大的时候是怎么扩大社交圈子的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}When you were my age, how did you broaden your social life?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.62,0:32:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛会持续到星期天\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The tournament goes until Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.20,0:32:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-带棋钟了吗  -没有\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Do you have a clock? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.20,0:33:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有棋钟共享制度 要是你的对手也没有棋钟\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We have a clock-sharing system. If your opponent doesn't have one,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.41,0:33:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你就回来 我们借你们一个\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}come back, and we'll loan you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛20分钟后开始\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Play starts in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的等级分是多少\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What's your rating?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.25,0:33:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有等级分\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't have a rating.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-你参加过比赛吗  -没有\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Have you played in a tournament before? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.79,0:33:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-你确定要参加吗  -确定\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Are you sure you wanna do this? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.41,0:33:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有女子组\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}We don't have a women's section.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.12,0:33:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-我让你参加初级组吧  -我不是新手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I'll put you in beginners. - I'm not a beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.25,0:33:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不重要\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是个没有等级的棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you're an unrated player,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.50,0:33:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你就应该跟等级分1600以下的人一起参加初级组\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}you go in beginners with the people under 1600.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.25,0:33:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-初级组的奖金是多少  -20美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- What's the prize for beginners? - Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-其他组别呢  -公开组第一名奖金是100美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- What about the other section? - First prize in the Open is 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.95,0:33:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我参加公开组算不算违规\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is it against any rule for me to be in the Open?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.29,0:33:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-不算  -那就让我参加公开组吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Not exactly. - Put me in the Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.50,0:33:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,公开组有三个等级分超过1800的选手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There are three guys in there with ratings over 1800.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.87,0:33:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,贝尔提克很可能会出现\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And Beltik may show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.62,0:33:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会把你杀得片甲不留\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They will eat you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.45,0:33:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"哈蒙"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}"Harmon."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.00,0:34:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,棋手都是随机配对的吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Are the matches played at random?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.16,0:34:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不是\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.50,0:34:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,第一轮按照棋手的等级分来配对\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Uh, they arrange it by ratings on the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.12,0:35:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,之后赢家对阵赢家 输家对阵输家\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}After that, winners play winners, and losers, losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.08,0:35:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.91,0:35:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.45,0:35:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-我叫安娜·派克  -我叫贝丝·哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Annette Packer. - Beth Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.70,0:35:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我对棋钟一窍不通\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't understand about chess clocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.75,0:35:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近你的那个棋钟用来计算你走棋的时间\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The clock faced nearest you measures your playing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.12,0:35:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,每个选手有90分钟\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Each player has 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.08,0:35:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,每走完一步 就按上面的按钮\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}After you move, you press that button on top,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你的棋钟就会暂停 对手的则开始计时\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and it stops your clock and starts your opponent's.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.83,0:35:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看到棋钟的数字12上面的小红旗了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And you see that little red flag over the number 12 on each clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,90分钟一到 你的小红旗就会掉下来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yours will fall down when the 90 minutes is up,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.33,0:35:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那也意味着...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and if it does that…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.37,0:35:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}you've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.29,0:35:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.08,0:36:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,用来记录你走的每步棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}For recording your moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.41,0:36:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.79,0:36:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以按下棋钟了  -你可以按下我的棋钟了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- You can start your clocks now. - You can start my clock now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.50,0:36:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要把女生分在一起\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Why do they put the girls together?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.12,0:36:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做本来就不妥...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They're not supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.00,0:36:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但要是你赢了 他们就会让你晋级\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}but, if you win, they move you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.16,0:36:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-摸子必动  -什么意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Oh, it's touch move. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.66,0:36:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰没打算移动的棋子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Don't touch a piece unless you're going to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.33,0:36:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要是碰着了 就必须移动那个棋子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you touch it, you have to move it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.45,0:36:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.41,0:36:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是应该按下你的按钮吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Don't you push your button now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.58,0:36:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.91,0:36:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个要怎么处理\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What I do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.58,0:36:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的比赛结束了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is your match over?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 我赢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.79,0:36:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真快\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么处理这个\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What do I do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.87,0:36:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的名字圈起来 然后放进篮子里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Circle your name and drop it in the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.83,0:38:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们是谁啊  -贝尔提克和卡伦\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Who are they? - Beltik and Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-贝尔提克是州冠军  -哪个是贝尔提克\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Beltik's the State Champion. - Which is which?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-年轻点儿的那个  -他是特级大师吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Beltik's the younger one. - Is he a Grandmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.20,0:38:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他的奋斗目标\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He's working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.29,0:38:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,需要时间\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.25,0:38:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,成为特级大师的前提是必须和特级大师下棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You have to play Grandmasters to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.50,0:38:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-那要多久  -可以安静一下吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- How much time? - Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.79,0:38:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,逼和\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.91,0:38:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,休想\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.50,0:38:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,将军\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's check.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.50,0:39:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂"将军"的意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.16,0:39:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,逼和\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.37,0:39:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.29,0:40:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我认输\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I resign.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.33,0:40:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是晚餐时段\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Dinner break.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.70,0:40:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,下一轮比赛6点开始 明天还有三轮\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Next round is at six o'clock. Then, three more tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.25,0:40:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一轮是在星期天上午11点\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Final round is Sunday, 11 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.79,0:40:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Harmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.12,0:40:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 小姑娘\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Keep it up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.00,0:40:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他知道你杀了他哥\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think he knew you killed his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.50,0:40:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-你有麻烦了...  -你那份在烤箱里\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- You're in trouble… - Yours is in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.00,0:40:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我总觉得有人跟踪我\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Someone's always crowding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.58,0:40:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-比赛顺利吗  -我连胜了四局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- How did you do at your thing? - I won four games.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.62,0:41:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这是好事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's nice, good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.75,0:41:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有事吗 哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Yes, Harmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.75,0:41:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你说有三个选手的等级分超过1800\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You said there were three people here with a rating higher than 1800.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.66,0:41:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错  -我还以为会跟他们中的一人交手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- That's right. - I thought I'd be playing one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.54,0:41:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,碰到他们才叫倒霉呢 哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Them's the breaks, Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.95,0:41:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你算走运了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Consider yourself lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟最出色的棋手对弈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I want to play the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.16,0:41:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,前提是你必须有等级分\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You have to get a rating before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.62,0:41:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么取得等级分\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How do I get a rating?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.00,0:41:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在美国国际象棋联盟下30局 然后等四个月\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You play 30 games in USCF tournaments, then wait four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.91,0:41:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-就能取得等级分了  -那也太久了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- That's how you get a rating. - That's too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.25,0:41:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟贝尔提克对弈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I want to play Beltik.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.25,0:41:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,除非接下来你连赢三局 贝尔提克也连赢三局\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}If you win your next three games, and if Beltik does the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.41,0:41:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我能打败他们\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I will win them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.45,0:41:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哈蒙 那是不可能的 你得先打败塞兹摩尔或戈德曼\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}No, Harmon, you won't. You have to play Sizemore or Goldman first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.33,0:41:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能打败他们\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You can't beat either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.70,0:41:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,打赢塞兹摩尔和戈德曼 别逗了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sizemore and Goldman? Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你接下来的对手汤斯是一个被低估的选手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Townes, the guy you're playing now, is underrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.83,0:41:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是大学队的顶级棋手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He plays first board for the university team,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.33,0:41:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,上个月他在拉斯维加斯拿下了第五名\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and last month he came in fifth in Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.16,0:42:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯有什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What's in Las Vegas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,美国国际象棋公开赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.50,0:42:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们一直在跟踪对方嘛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Looks like we've been stalking each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要按下我的棋钟吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You want to start my clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.50,0:42:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.04,0:44:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 哈蒙 你这是在羞辱我的车\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Jesus Christ, Harmon, you're humiliating my rook.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.25,0:44:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它的痛苦很快就会结束了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}He won't have to suffer much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.00,0:44:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.62,0:45:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你今年几岁\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.37,0:45:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.33,0:45:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-别回答 知道了只会令我更沮丧  -我今年36岁\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Don't answer that, it'll just depress me. - I'm 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.16,0:45:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.70,0:45:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不简单 你知道吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You really are something, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.20,0:45:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,去交记录表吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Shall we turn in our sheets?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.25,0:45:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你先去吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Um… you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.50,0:45:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我想再研究一会儿这盘棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm gonna study the board a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.58,0:45:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.25,0:46:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你说 我从来没见过像你这么...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I just wanted to tell you that I've never seen anything like…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.41,0:46:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有准备东西\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Do... Do you have something?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.25,0:46:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次来月经\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.33,0:46:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,知道怎么用吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Do you know how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.95,0:46:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,应该知道吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.75,0:46:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这边等你 要帮忙就说一声\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll wait, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.00,0:46:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.16,0:46:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你晋级了吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're moving right on up, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.33,0:46:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,目前是晋级了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.33,0:46:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,塞兹摩尔是个很强的对手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sizemore's pretty tough, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.12,0:47:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.66,0:47:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.91,0:47:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I just thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.95,0:47:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我病了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thought I was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次来月经的时候还吐了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}My first time, I threw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.62,0:47:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在偶尔还会吐\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well, I still do sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,其实每次来月经都会吐\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Actually, every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.29,0:47:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回去比赛了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Well, I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.91,0:47:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.87,0:47:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 贝丝\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Hey, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.12,0:47:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,打败他 好吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beat him, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.62,0:47:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我会尽力的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.79,0:47:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.25,0:48:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我来月经了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've started menstruating.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.33,0:48:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,算迟了 对吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Bit late in the day for you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.66,0:48:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要卫生巾...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll need pads…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.16,0:48:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.50,0:48:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我房间里有个小衣橱 最上面一格抽屉就有\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Just go up to my room, to the top drawer of my chiffonier,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.20,0:48:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,想拿什么就拿吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and take what you require.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.04,0:48:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 亲爱的...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Oh, and, dear…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.45,0:48:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我把床头那个装有绿色药丸的瓶子拿来\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}be a good girl and get that little bottle of green pills by my bedside.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.87,0:48:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要再补充镇静剂\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}My tranquility needs to be refurbished.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.45,0:49:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.54,0:49:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.79,0:49:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,出事\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.95,0:49:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是亚里士多德 不过是的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'm not Aristotle, but yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.45,0:49:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为有些可以理解为出事了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I think something could be construed as wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.20,0:49:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我从惠特利先生那里得到消息\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've received a message from Mr. Wheatley.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.70,0:50:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看来惠特利先生...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It seems Mr. Wheatley…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.45,0:50:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,被无限期地留在了西南部\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}has been indefinitely detained in the Southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.37,0:50:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在丹佛和比尤特之间的某个地方\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Somewhere between Denver and Butte.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.95,0:50:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但亚里士多德是个哲学家 我只是个家庭主妇\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Though, Aristotle was a moral philosopher, and I'm just a housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.54,0:50:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,或者说曾经是\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Or I was a housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.20,0:50:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你没了丈夫 我会不会被送回去\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Can they send me back if you no longer have a husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.54,0:50:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You put it concretely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.33,0:50:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遮掩一下就不会\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}They won't if we lie about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.16,0:50:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那应该不难\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}That's easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.12,0:50:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,贝丝 你是个好孩子\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You're a good soul, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.79,0:51:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我加热一下冰箱里的鸡肉吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Why don't you heat up the chicken dinners in the freezer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.20,0:51:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,烤箱的温度设定在400度\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Set the oven at 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.45,0:51:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会用烤箱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I don't know how to put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.04,0:51:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我已经不是人妻了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Though I'm no longer a wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.87,0:51:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有名无实而已...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}except by a legal fiction…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.54,0:51:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我应该可以学习如何为人母\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I believe I can learn to be a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.87,0:51:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我教你怎么用...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll show you how…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.58,0:51:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你得答应我别去丹佛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}if you promise to never go near Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.83,0:52:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.70,0:52:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.66,0:53:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.08,0:53:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,多喝了一杯咖啡\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Extra cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.08,0:53:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫哈利·贝尔提克 你呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Harry Beltik. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.08,0:53:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫贝丝·哈蒙\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.16,0:55:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我去去就回\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.91,0:56:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,振作起来 你这狼狈的垃圾\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Come on, you ugly piece of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.66,0:56:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你能打败那个...\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You can beat that…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.79,0:56:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢逼\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}fucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.87,0:57:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-混蛋  -认输吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- Son of a bitch. - I think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.70,0:57:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行 我能突破重围  -不太可能\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- No, I can get out of this. - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.12,0:57:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你刚才准时到场或许还可以\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Maybe, if you'd gotten here on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.00,0:58:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,行不通吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.91,0:58:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不必动用后  -走吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I don't have to use the queen. - Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.75,0:58:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-只要动用象来掩护...  -走吧\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}- I'll just cover it with the bishop and... - Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.79,0:58:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Do you see it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.00,0:58:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说我们一起下完这盘棋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Or should we finish this on the board?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.75,0:58:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.04,0:59:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"肯塔基州棋艺界本周末迎来震撼消息\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}"The world of Kentucky chess was astonished this weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.70,0:59:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一名土生土长的女孩连续打败几位最强劲的对手\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}by the playing of a local girl who triumphed over hardened players
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.66,0:59:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一举成为肯塔基州国际象棋锦标赛冠军"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}to win the Kentucky State Championship."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.91,0:59:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"伊丽莎白·哈蒙 目前就读于费尔菲尔德高中\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}"Elizabeth Harmon, a student at Fairfield High,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.75,0:59:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在比赛中展现出从未有女棋手可媲美的高超棋艺\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}showed a mastery of the game unequaled by any female,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.37,0:59:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,以上是哈利·贝尔提克的发言\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}according to Harry Beltik,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.08,0:59:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,后者在争夺州锦标赛冠军时败给了哈蒙小姐"\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}whom Miss Harmon defeated for the state crown."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.45,0:59:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你还赢了100美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}And 100 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.41,0:59:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你赢的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}You won this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.33,0:59:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开一个银行账户\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I wanna open a bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.79,0:59:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你得跟我一起去 家长或监护人必须在场\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}But you have to go with me, because I need a parent or a guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.87,0:59:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全没想到有人居然能靠下棋挣钱\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I just didn't have the faintest idea that people made money playing chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.79,0:59:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有些锦标赛的奖金更多\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}There's tournaments with bigger prizes than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.54,0:59:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,多了多少\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}How much bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.54,0:59:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好几千\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Thousands of dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.70,1:00:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.50,1:00:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,今天放学后我们就去银行 行吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}So, can we go to the bank today after school?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.00,1:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.20,1:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,贝丝 下来一下好吗\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Beth, will you come down here, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.37,1:01:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.95,1:01:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在翻看这本棋艺杂志\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've been leafing through this chess magazine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.45,1:01:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.75,1:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,上面说辛辛那提即将举办一场锦标赛\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It says here that there is a tournament in Cincinnati,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.58,1:01:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,第一名的奖金是500美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}and the first prize is 500 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.62,1:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,坐长途车两个小时就能到\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The Greyhound bus only requires two hours for the trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.66,1:01:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经订了票\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I took the liberty of calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.54,1:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么跟学校交代呢\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}What about school?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.62,1:01:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以替你请个病假 说你得了接吻病\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I could write a medical excuse claiming mono.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.41,1:01:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mono?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.41,1:01:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,单核细胞增多症\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Mononucleosis.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.54,1:01:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"妇女家庭杂志"上说你这个年纪的女孩常常得这种病\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}It's quite the thing in your age group, according to the Ladies Home Journal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.54,1:01:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们住哪儿\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Where would we stay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.04,1:01:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,吉普森酒店的双人房每晚收22美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}At the Gibson Hotel, in a double room for 22 dollars a night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.75,1:02:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一张长途车票是11.80美元\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}The Greyhound tickets would be $11.80 apiece,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.58,1:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,加上伙食费\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}plus the cost of food.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.25,1:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我都算好了\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I've calculated all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.58,1:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你只得第二名或第三名\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}Even if you only won second or third prize,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.83,1:02:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是有进账的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}there would still be a profit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.87,1:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我会赢的\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I'll win.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.41,1:02:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你有信心\N{\c&H62a8eb&\fs13}I have every confidence.


